brf_src:["Weather: aviationweather.gov (NOAA). SIGMET/AIRMET: aviationweather.gov; GAMET: REDEMET (DECEA). NOTAMs: FAA NOTAM Search (ICAO international NOTAMs). For simulation only — not for real-world navigation.","Meteorologia: aviationweather.gov (NOAA). SIGMET/AIRMET: aviationweather.gov; GAMET: REDEMET (DECEA). NOTAMs: pesquisa de NOTAMs da FAA (NOTAMs internacionais ICAO). Apenas para simulação — não use para navegação real.","Meteorología: aviationweather.gov (NOAA). NOTAM: búsqueda de NOTAM de la FAA (NOTAM internacionales OACI). Solo para simulación — no usar en navegación real.","Météo : aviationweather.gov (NOAA). NOTAM : recherche NOTAM de la FAA (NOTAM internationaux OACI). Pour la simulation uniquement — pas pour la navigation réelle.","Wetter: aviationweather.gov (NOAA). NOTAMs: FAA NOTAM Search (internationale ICAO-NOTAMs). Nur für die Simulation — nicht für reale Navigation.","気象：aviationweather.gov（NOAA）。NOTAM：FAA NOTAM検索（ICAO国際NOTAM）。シミュレーション専用です。実運航には使用しないでください。","气象：aviationweather.gov（NOAA）。NOTAM：FAA NOTAM检索（ICAO国际NOTAM）。仅供模拟——请勿用于真实导航。","기상: aviationweather.gov(NOAA). NOTAM: FAA NOTAM 검색(ICAO 국제 NOTAM). 시뮬레이션 전용 — 실제 항법에 사용하지 마세요."],
